      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "روزه‌داران که تشنهٔ\u00A0زارند",
      "CoupletIndex": 19,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 21
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 40,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "چشم در راه شام من دارند",
      "CoupletIndex": 19,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 21
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 41,
